Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"GAGAK lang siya, walang divine fire" ... "Kung phoenix siya o hindi, WALA kang pakialam."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sino bang nagpaalam na galawin mo siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.44,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Feng Qiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Dahil lang sa outsider,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:08.26,S_fil,,0,0,0,,sasampalin mo ang Golden Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.74,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Masakit ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.14,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Konti lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Malinaw na malinaw, uwak lang siya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,walang phoenix blood, walang divine fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hangin pa lang niya, iba na sa phoenix clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hanggang kailan mo ilolokohin ang sarili mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Oo nga, oo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bilisan mo, kumbinsihin mo siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.18,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa'yo nakasalalay ang lahat ngayon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.58,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung phoenix ba siya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:28.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,wala kang pakialam.
